          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 96457,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oltre a selezionare semplicemente gli elementi, possiamo usare le query per eseguire operazioni sui dati di una tabella, come quelli in <code>ticket</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE ticket (&#xA; museum varchar(255),&#xA; price numeric(2,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Louvre', 17);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Petit Palais', 0);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Centre Pompidou', 14);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Musée Rodin', 9);&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;\"><tables><table name=\"ticket\"><row><header content=\"museum\" /><header content=\"price\" /></row><row><data content=\"Louvre\" /><data content=\"17\" /></row><row><data content=\"Petit Palais\" /><data content=\"0\" /></row><row><data content=\"Centre Pompidou\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row><row><data content=\"Musée Rodin\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "MIN",
            "id": 96458,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una di queste operazioni consiste nel selezionare il valore più piccolo in una colonna.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE ticket (&#xA; museum varchar(255),&#xA; price numeric(2,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Louvre', 17);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Petit Palais', 0);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Centre Pompidou', 14);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Musée Rodin', 9);&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;\"><tables><table name=\"ticket\"><row><header content=\"museum\" /><header content=\"price\" /></row><row><data content=\"Louvre\" /><data content=\"17\" /></row><row><data content=\"Petit Palais\" /><data content=\"0\" /></row><row><data content=\"Centre Pompidou\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row><row><data content=\"Musée Rodin\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"MIN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(price)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticket;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DISTINCT\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"MIN(price)\" /></row><row><data content=\"0\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>MIN(price)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "MIN 2",
            "id": 96475,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per selezionare il valore <em>più piccolo</em> in una colonna come <code>price</code>, scrivi <code>MIN</code> e il nome della colonna tra parentesi.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE ticket (&#xA; museum varchar(255),&#xA; price numeric(2,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Louvre', 17);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Petit Palais', 0);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Centre Pompidou', 14);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Musée Rodin', 9);&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;\"><tables><table name=\"ticket\"><row><header content=\"museum\" /><header content=\"price\" /></row><row><data content=\"Louvre\" /><data content=\"17\" /></row><row><data content=\"Petit Palais\" /><data content=\"0\" /></row><row><data content=\"Centre Pompidou\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row><row><data content=\"Musée Rodin\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"MIN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(price)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticket;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"MIN(price)\" /></row><row><data content=\"0\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>MIN</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>price</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "MAX",
            "id": 96478,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per ottenere il valore <em>massimo</em>, scrivi <code>MAX</code> e la colonna <code>price</code> tra parentesi <code>()</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE ticket (&#xA; museum varchar(255),&#xA; price numeric(2,1)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Louvre', 17);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Petit Palais', 0);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Centre Pompidou', 14);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO ticket (museum, price)&#xA;VALUES ('Musée Rodin', 9);&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;\"><tables><table name=\"ticket\"><row><header content=\"museum\" /><header content=\"price\" /></row><row><data content=\"Louvre\" /><data content=\"17\" /></row><row><data content=\"Petit Palais\" /><data content=\"0\" /></row><row><data content=\"Centre Pompidou\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row><row><data content=\"Musée Rodin\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"MAX\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(price)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticket;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"MAX(price)\" /></row><row><data content=\"17\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>MAX(price)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: MIN 2",
            "id": 96917,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operazione seleziona il valore più piccolo in una colonna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>MIN</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BETWEEN</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>MIN</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una tabella memorizza i totali degli ordini. Quale funzione restituisce il totale più basso di quella colonna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>MIN</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>MAX</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>BETWEEN</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>MIN</code>.</p></body></html>"
